# =====================================================================
# MUST NOT be published. Personal documents and private job-search work.
# Luna's resume carries a phone number. The search spreadsheets and the
# workbook generators are private. They live in this folder for
# convenience only and must never reach the public repo.
# =====================================================================
*.pdf
*.xlsx
*.docx
*.csv
~$*
scripts/generate_luna_*_workbook.py

# =====================================================================
# Tooling that assisted the build. Machine specific, not part of the site.
# =====================================================================
.claude/
CLAUDE.md
.cursor/
.aider*
.continue/

