# Working files from building the site. Regenerable, so not committed.
# Only the final chosen images are copied up into assets/.
# =====================================================================
assets/pdf_extract/
*.dc.html
_*.html
*.tmp
*.bak
*~
shots/
screenshots/

# =====================================================================
